        <h2 id="bingo">3. Hosting US 75-Ball vs. UK 90-Ball Bingo Without a Cage</h2>
        <p>
          Metal Bingo cages are loud on microphones, shed missing balls under couches, and often clump newly dropped balls near the top. Running family night, a senior-center social, or a remote Zoom Bingo call on our <a href="/bingo-number-generator-1-75">Bingo Number Generator 1–75 Wheel</a> takes less than a minute to dial in—and works for both major international formats:
        </p>

